    {
      "id": "s0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "NAME",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] - A command line interface for SQLite version 3",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SYNOPSIS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] [[[p1]]] [[[p2]]] [[[p3]]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "options"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "databasefile"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "SQL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SUMMARY",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] is a terminal-based front-end to the SQLite library that can evaluate queries interactively and display the results in multiple formats. [[p1]] can also be used within shell scripts and other applications to provide batch processing features.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To start a [[p0]] interactive session, invoke the [[p1]] command and optionally provide the name of a database file. If the database file does not exist, it will be created. If the database file does exist, it will be opened.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For example, to create a new database file named \"mydata.db\", create a table named \"memos\" and insert a couple of records into that table:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "$ [[p0]]sqlite3 mydata.db[[p1]] [[p2]] SQLite version 3.43.2 2023-10-10 13:08:14 [[p3]] Enter \".help\" for usage hints. [[p4]] sqlite> [[p5]]CREATE TABLE memos(text, priority INTEGER);[[p6]] [[p7]] sqlite> [[p8]]INSERT INTO memos VALUES('deliver project description', 10);[[p9]] [[p10]] sqlite> [[p11]]INSERT INTO memos VALUES('lunch with Christine', 100);[[p12]] [[p13]] sqlite> [[p14]]SELECT * FROM memos;[[p15]] [[p16]] deliver project description|10 [[p17]] lunch with Christine|100 [[p18]] sqlite>",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p4]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p5]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p6]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p7]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p8]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p9]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p10]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p11]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p12]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p13]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p14]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p15]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p16]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p17]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p18]]",
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If no database name is supplied, the ATTACH sql command can be used to attach to existing or create new database files. ATTACH can also be used to attach to multiple databases within the same interactive session. This is useful for migrating data between databases, possibly changing the schema along the way.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Optionally, a SQL statement or set of SQL statements can be supplied as a single argument. Multiple statements should be separated by semi-colons.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For example:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "$ [[p0]]sqlite3 [[p1]] mydata.db 'SELECT * FROM memos WHERE priority > 20;'[[p2]] [[p3]] text = lunch with Christine [[p4]] priority = 100",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-line"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p3]]",
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p4]]",
          "text": "\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SQLITE META-COMMANDS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The interactive interpreter offers a set of meta-commands that can be used to control the output format, examine the currently attached database files, or perform administrative operations upon the attached databases (such as rebuilding indices). Meta-commands are always prefixed with a dot (.).",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "A list of available meta-commands can be viewed at any time by issuing the '.help' command. For example:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "sqlite> [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": ".help"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The available commands differ by version and build options, so they are not listed here. Please refer to your local copy for all available options.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "OPTIONS",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] has the following options:",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0022",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]] ARGS...[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-A"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Run [[p0]].archive ARGS[[p1]] and exit",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0024",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-append"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Append the database to the end of the file.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-ascii"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output mode to 'ascii'.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0028",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-bail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Stop after hitting an error.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0030",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-batch"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Force batch I/O.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0032",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-box"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output mode to 'box'.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0034",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-column"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Query results will be displayed in a table like form, using whitespace characters to separate the columns and align the output.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0036",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-cmd"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "command"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "run [[p0]] before reading stdin",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "command"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0038",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-csv"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output mode to CSV (comma separated values).",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0040",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-deserialize"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open the database using sqlite3_deserialize()",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0042",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-echo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Print commands before execution.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0044",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-init"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "file"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Read and execute commands from [[p0]] , which can contain a mix of SQL statements and meta-commands.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "file"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0046",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-[no]header"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Turn headers on or off.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0048",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-help"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Show help on options and exit.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0050",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]] key[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-hexkey"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open database with hexadecimal encryption key.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0052",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Query results will be output as simple HTML tables.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0054",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-interactive"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Force interactive I/O.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0056",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]] key[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-key"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open database with raw encryption key [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "key"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0058",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output mode to 'json'.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0060",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-line"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Query results will be displayed with one value per line, rows separated by a blank line. Designed to be easily parsed by scripts or other programs",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0062",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-list"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Query results will be displayed with the separator (|, by default) character between each field value. The default.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0064",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]]size n[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-lookaside"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use [[p0]] entries of [[p1]] bytes for lookaside memory",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "n"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "size"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0066",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-markdown"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output mode to 'markdown'.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0068",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]] N[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-maxsize"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Limits size of a [[p0]] database to [[p1]] bytes",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-deserialize"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "N"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0070",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-memtrace"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Trace all memory allocations.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0072",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-newline"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "sep"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set output row separator. Default is '\\n'.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0074",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-nofollow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Refuse to open paths containing symbolic links.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0076",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]] string[[p2]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "-nonce"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set the safe-mode escape nonce to [[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0078",
      "kind": "term",
      "text": "[[p0]][[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-nullvalue"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Set string used to represent NULL values. Default is '' (empty string).",
