    {
      "id": "s0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "INIT FILE",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]] reads an initialization file to set the configuration of the interactive environment. Throughout initialization, any previously specified setting can be overridden. The sequence of initialization is as follows:",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "sqlite3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "o The default configuration is established as follows:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "o If the file [[p0]] or [[p1]] exists, the first of those to be found is processed during startup. It should generally only contain meta-commands.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "${XDG_CONFIG_HOME}/sqlite3/sqliterc"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "~/.sqliterc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "o If the [[p0]] option is present, the specified file is processed.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "-init"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "o All other command line options are processed.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0108",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SEE ALSO",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "https://sqlite.org/cli.html [[p0]] https://sqlite.org/fiddle (a WebAssembly build of the CLI app) [[p1]] The sqlite3-doc package.",
      "protected": [
